POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "input": "시력이 나쁜 것과 난독증과 관련이 있을까?"
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "params": {
    "from_lang": "korean",
    "to_lang": "english"
  },
  "input": "일련의 값들을 가지고 있는 자료구조를 구성할 때, 대부분 '슬라이스'를 사용한다."
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "params": {
    "from_lang": "english",
    "to_lang": "korean"
  },
  "input": "It takes a great deal of bravery to stand up to our enemies, but just as much to stand up to our friends."
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "input": "Prompt 를 Subject 정보를 참조하여 생성하도록 수정"
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/4
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "params":{
    "level": "A1"
  },
  "input": "A spokesperson for the Secret Service said in a statement Saturday that the agency has not provided certain resources in the past but has instead provided other security measures including from local partners. The news comes amid widespread concerns about how a sniper was able to obtain rooftop access roughly 150 meters from Trump’s position at an outdoor rally in Butler, Pennsylvania, last week."
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/5
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "params":{
    "level": "A1"
  },
  "input": "The madder the Hulk gets, the stronger he gets."
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat/user/1/subject/5
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "input": "madder 나 stronger 앞에 the 는 왜 붙는거야?",
  "without_prompt": true
}

